{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02502","headline":"安德山池宴集 · 褚遂良","name":"安德山池宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伏枥丹霞外，遮园焕景舒。\n行云泛层阜，蔽月下清渠。\n亭中奏赵瑟，席上舞燕裾。\n花落春莺晚，风光夏叶初。\n良朋比兰蕙，雕藻迈琼琚。\n独有狂歌客，来承欢宴余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚遂良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}